{
    "id": "postman-sprites",
    "title": "用精灵图演的邮差",
    "asks": ["story", "film", "characters"],
    "prompt": "assets 里有邮差走路（walk.png，一组 8 张）和挥手（wave.png，一组 6 张）的精灵图，用它们做一条 20 秒的短片，讲邮差送一封迟到了很久的信。",
    "workspace": {
        "assets/walk.png": {
            "generator": "repo",
            "from": "examples/postman-wave/assets/walk.png"
        },
        "assets/wave.png": {
            "generator": "repo",
            "from": "examples/postman-wave/assets/wave.png"
        },
        "assets/SOURCES.json": {
            "generator": "copy",
            "from": "files/SOURCES.json"
        }
    },
    "timeoutMin": 45,
    "expect": {
        "durationSec": [19, 21],
        "width": 1920,
        "height": 1080,
        "audio": "score",
        "uses": ["loadSprite("],
        "files": ["assets/sprites/*/clips.json"],
        "review": [
            "走路时着地的脚钉在地上不打滑，走完停在一轮的第一张上",
            "走路和挥手之间是硬切，没有两张叠着淡入淡出",
            "精灵上没有再加 boil 抖动，两套动作里人一样大",
            "只用了图里画了的动作，没有拿旋转、拉伸去凑图里没有的动作"
        ]
    }
}
